{"decisions":[{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/upkeep","statement":"The slug of a page type is singular."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A page type says here how its page stands on a screen of its own."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A page type says here whether its pages are rendered as audio or as an image."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A page type says here how its pages are grouped and ordered into a run."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A page type says here whether the taboo terms are judged over its pages."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A page type says here whether the paths its pages spell are a container's."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/absence","statement":"A page type says nothing about where the pages of that page type sit."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A page type's type is written beside that page type rather than written by hand."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A declaration beside that type is a calculation rather than the page's own shape."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"The pages of a page type are reached by that page type rather than by the folder those pages sit in."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A page type states the component drawing a page of that page type."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A component a page type states is held in files beside that page type."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/absence","statement":"No page type states a display for a screen to resolve to a component."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A page type states the component drawing a page property's value as a badge."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A page type states the component drawing a page property's whole row, its label with its value."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A page type states the component drawing a page of that page type as a chip."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A page type states the component drawing a page of that page type as a row."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A page type states the component drawing a page of that page type as a card."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/absence","statement":"No registry keyed by a page type's slug picks how a page of that type is drawn."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A page type stating no component of a kind takes the component the page type it extends states."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A screen finds a page type's component by walking the types that page type extends."}]}
{"definition":"the specification for a kind of page"}
